    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d63">

                <pb facs="0178" n="62" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg62"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/938.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chinese Republican Minister for
                            Foreign Affairs to the Secretary of
                            State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-01-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 19, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Manchu Government having entered into negotiation with Republic of China for
                    purpose of abdicating their entire sovereign rights, power and privileges, we
                    fervently pray recognition, to avoid disastrous interregnum.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wang Chung Hui</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
